 "transcript": [
  "[action] (to the eldest son, the second son) Wang Lung looks at his sons and sees their wealth.",
  "[says] (to the second son) The eldest son invites his father to his house.",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"Now we will live in the great house and we will have more servants and we will be able to eat better and drink better and we will be able to see and hear and know all that is going on in the town,\"",
  "[action] The eldest son invites his father to his house.",
  "[action] (to the eldest son) Wang Lung agrees to live in his son's house.",
  "Wang Lung: \"Well, and I will come to your house, my son.\"",
  "[action] Wang Lung prepares to go to his son's house.",
  "[action] Wang Lung sits down, exhausted, and weeps.",
  "Wang Lung: \"Now I am an old man, and I have lived through all my years, and I have no more business with this land except to die upon it.\"",
  "[action] Wang Lung weeps and leans on his staff.",
  "[action] The sons prepare to sell the land.",
  "[action] The sons measure the land for sale.",
  "[action] (to the eldest son, the second son) Wang Lung's sons measure the land.",
  "Wang Lung: \"What price will you ask for this land?\"",
  "[says] (to the second son) Eldest son proposes a price for the land.",
  "the eldest son (to the second son): \"Well, and my brother, let us ask two pieces of silver for it, for it is well worth it.\"",
  "[silence] the second son says nothing.",
  "[action] The second son proposes a higher price for the land.",
  "[action] The eldest son asks for more money.",
  "[action] Wang Lung sits and listens."
